[The Brainf*** compiler by Ryan Kusnery
(completed 6:40 pm; wed; apr 7; 1999) (the last bug squashed at 7:43 pm)

This program has three patches in it and the compiled programs it
produces include self-modifying code and jumps to addresses contained in
registers. Also I had to kluge it so that it never outputs the LF
character, because of the problem caused by converting LFs to CRLFs.]

